For \(m\in\mathbb N\): \(\Lambda_m:=\frac{\pi(m-1)(m-3)}{4m^3}\);
\(\Lambda'_m:=\frac{\pi}{4m}\max\bigl(\frac14,\frac{(m-3)(m-9)}{m^2}\bigr)\); and
\(D_m:=\{(\tfrac{m-1}2,m),(\tfrac{m+1}2,m)\}\) (for odd \(m\)).

